Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.75,0:13:51.07,Shiina日,11,0,0,0,,いたたたたたっ!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:48.75,0:13:51.07,Shiina中,10,0,0,0,,好痛痛痛痛痛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.81,0:13:48.93,Screen,,0,0,0,,{\an6\fn@5JYOFGZC\c&H8580F7&\bord2\3c&H4E46E7&\fs80\frz310.4\pos(242.29,836.57)\fsp20}好痛痛痛
